 "topic": "Hyde Island hunt: explore Hyde Island alone as Jason or Lucia until a tranquilizer dart drops you; you wake in a container with no gear while a hunter with a sniper rifle and a tracking dog hunts you; kill him for the Island-Poacher sniper rifle and cash, die and you lose money",
