 "summary": "GTA 6 has a secret hunt, and you're the prey. Go to Hyde Island alone, as Jason or Lucia, and explore. Out of nowhere a tranquilizer dart drops you, and you wake up in a container with no weapons and no gear. Then the hunt starts: a hunter with a sniper rifle and a tracking dog. Die and you lose cash; take him down and you get his Island-Poacher sniper, plus cash.",
